#: ../../src/ondisk/xattrs.md:99 b5c356e2f188424293bd7bb986ed380b
msgid "Each inline or shared xattr entry has the following layout:"
msgstr "每个内联或共享 xattr 条目都具有以下布局："

#: ../../src/ondisk/xattrs.md beddea78986f4748833c0c5ff3a3d9cd
